      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's really frustrating not being able to fly the camera in worlds with custom movement.\n\nHere's a related canny with the same topic, although now kind of outdated as when it was made VRCCameraSettings or the drone camera did not exist. Yet it's still an issue.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/udon-receives-input-events-whilst-using-drone-camera",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
